From f44ea29395cdfb85d7d28795d7484e70571da132 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:05:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dwc2d: wait for received frames with the controller interrupt

Enable the channel-halted interrupt of the receive channel only and
replace the yield loop with an event queue over the IRQ, the network
scheme and a timer for the keyboard. Without an IRQ the timer polls
every 10 ms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
